<!-- ============ 路线总览 ============ -->
<section id="p0" class="panel active">
  <div class="card">
    <h2><span class="dot"></span>题目在做什么？</h2>
    <p class="lead">目标是合成药物<b>咪达唑仑</b>的中间体 <b>K</b>。整条路线分成两支，最后合并：</p>
    <div class="route" style="margin-top:6px">
      <div class="rrow">
        <div class="node">A</div><div class="arrow">Fe / HCl</div>
        <div class="node">B</div><div class="arrow">2-氟苯甲酰氯 / ZnCl₂</div>
        <div class="node">C</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rrow">
        <div class="node">D</div><div class="arrow">(i) Boc₂O (ii) Py·SO₃</div>
        <div class="node">E</div><div class="arrow">CH₃NO₂ / KF</div>
        <div class="node">F</div><div class="arrow">CH₃SO₂Cl / 碱</div>
        <div class="node">G</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rrow">
        <div class="node">C + G</div><div class="arrow">Δ（已知反应）</div>
        <div class="node">H</div><div class="arrow">Fe / 乙酸</div>
        <div class="node">I</div><div class="arrow">(i) HCl (ii) NaHCO₃</div>
        <div class="node">J</div><div class="arrow">CH₃C(OCH₃)₃</div>
        <div class="node goal">K</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h2><span class="dot"></span>已知信息（题目给出）</h2>
    <div class="mol" style="font-size:16px">
      R–NH₂ &nbsp;+&nbsp; R′–CH=CH–NO₂ &nbsp;<span style="color:#2563eb">——Δ——▶</span>&nbsp; R–NH–CH(R′)–CH₂NO₂
    </div>
    <p class="lead" style="margin-top:8px">这是一个 <b>Michael 加成</b>：胺上的氮加到硝基烯烃的 β-碳上，生成 β-硝基胺。</p>
    <div class="flexline" style="margin-top:12px">
      <span class="pill">看不懂没关系</span>
      <span class="pill">点上方标签，一块一块拆开看</span>
    </div>
  </div>
